    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Who lives in a pineapple under the sea? SpongeBob SquarePants! The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "character",
            "ref": "v-character"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " has lots of fans, young and old. But do you know who created him? It was Stephen Hillenburg (1961—2018)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Hillenburg loved both drawing and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "marine biology",
            "zh": "海洋生物学"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "used to",
            "ref": "v-used-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "曾经"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " be a marine biology teacher. He wrote stories and used them to teach. He also drew characters for his stories. These characters then became SpongeBob and his friends."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Hillenburg said he was “great at art and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "so-so",
            "zh": "一般般"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " at marine biology”. “It’s funny how the two came together at last,” he said. There are a lot of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "details",
            "ref": "v-detail"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the undersea world of SpongeBob. They show Hillenburg’s knowledge of marine life."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The TV show helps teach us about "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "optimism",
            "zh": "乐观"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "friendship",
            "ref": "v-friendship"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and more. It is loved by many."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
